{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37508","headline":"春日游北园寄韩侍郎 · 周朴","name":"春日游北园寄韩侍郎","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"灼灼春园晚色分，露珠千点映寒云。\n多情舞蝶穿花去，解语流莺隔水闻。\n冷酒桮中宜泛灩，暖风林下自氛氲。\n仙桃不肯全开拆，应借余芳待使君。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"周朴","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37508.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37508","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}